+- [Should-fix] §4.4 "whole parts are included from the most specific … towards the most general until the budget is spent. A part that does not fit is omitted whole" and warning "general sections will be omitted at session start" — The packing rule is ambiguous between stop-at-first-overflow and skip-and-continue. Under skip-and-continue an oversized seat AGENTS.md is dropped while global and teamspace rules are kept (the iteration-1 inversion, with the header still saying "later section wins"); under stop the seat gets header plus marker only. In both cases the fixed warning text misstates the outcome, and the variable-length marker line's bytes are not reserved in the 9000-byte budget. (regressed from iteration 1 "§4.4 prefix truncation": fix incomplete)
