+- [Should-fix] Goal "No agent can change what another agent is instructed to do… Every instruction source is editable only through a plan"; §2.1 closed file set; §3.5 residual vectors; Out of scope — The spec never addresses the instruction files Claude Code and Codex load on their own from each seat's cwd and its ancestors (`CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `AGENTS.override.md`). Seats share the teamspace `project_repo` as cwd, and seats without one use a fallback cwd under the instance's git-ignored `.graph-local/`. A plain working-tree write there changes what co-located seats are told, with no plan, no `apply` and no trace in the committed-revision render. The spec neither gates it, lists it as a §3.5 residual, nor puts it out of scope. (new)
