+  fix-shape hint: Add harness-native project instruction files to §3.5 residuals and Out of scope (and the SKILL/README copy); optionally move the fallback cwd outside the instance repository or have doctor warn on `AGENTS*.md`/`CLAUDE*.md` under `.graph-local/`.
